        "name": "USN-3010-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that Expat unexpectedly called srand in certain circumstances. This could reduce the security of calling applications. (CVE-2012-6702)  It was discovered that Expat incorrectly handled seeding the random number generator. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2016-5300)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2012-6702",
          "CVE-2016-5300"
        ]
